# Force LF line endings for all text files in the repository, regardless of
# the committer's OS/core.autocrlf setting. This repo is edited from both a
# native Windows checkout and a Linux devcontainer sharing the same
# bind-mounted working directory — without this, Windows's autocrlf=true
# checks files out with CRLF while the devcontainer's git (no autocrlf) sees
# every line as changed against the LF blobs actually stored in git.
* text=auto eol=lf
